			String _text = "Collect and harvest fodder-thatch patches in the selected area. Tips: Fodder-thatch is the material you get from harvesting patches of grass you can see on the ground. Fodder can be used in the stables, can be made into firebundles(firewood by woodcutters), can be used as building material(apiary, fenceless pasture, fodder barn...). each patch of grass creates 4-6 fodder-thatch (value 1). These are stored in a construction stockpile.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearFlower";
			String _text = "Collect Flowers";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearFlowerLwr";
			String _text = "collect flowers";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearFlowerTip";
			String _text = "Collect and harvest flowers spawns in the selected area. Tips: Flowers have the miscellaneous flag. Each patch of flowers create 3-5 flowers (value 1). Make sure you have barns that accept miscellaneous items.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearHerb";
			String _text = "Collect Herbs";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearHerbLwr";
			String _text = "collect herbs";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearHerbTip";
			String _text = "Collect and harvest herbs spawns in the selected area. Tips: Herbs are used at an herbalist (or bathhouse) to get back 1/2 heart per used. Each patch of herbs create 2-3 herbs (value 4). Herbs require barn type of storage.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearCopper";
			String _text = "Collect Copper and Tin";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearCopperLwr";
			String _text = "collect copper";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearCopperTip";
			String _text = "Collect all copper, Tin and other rare minerals (gold and silver) in the selected area. Tips: Copper is used to make some tools and also as building materials. Copper and the other rare ores are minerals. Make sure you have material stockpile available. 2-3 Copper ores are extracted (value 4), 1-2 silver ores (value 11) or 1-2 gold ores (value 22). Make sure you have minerals stockpile available to store those. ";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearAlmostAll";
			String _text = "Collect Almost All";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearAlmostAllLwr";
			String _text = "collect almost all";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearAlmostAllTip";
			String _text = "Collect all ores and stones in the selected area. Tips: This special tool will gather all ores and all stones. Will do not remove the trees and grass and other valuable wild things. Very useful to clean up fast all the lands around foresters.";
		}
		{
			String _name = "ClearFirewood";
			String _text = "Collect Dead wood";
		}
